The system then looks for reusable patterns shared by both.

Possible extracted primitives:

Narrative Delay

An unfinished sequence can postpone an unwanted terminal event.

Curiosity Leverage

A future reward can redirect present behavior without direct force.

Numerical Portal

A number can act as a bridge into a story, culture, symbol, or historical reference.

Additive Threshold

The next small unit after a large accumulation can change the meaning of the entire sequence.

Survival Through Continuation

Creating something worth returning to can preserve the creator.

