Pantheon Interpretation

Within the Pantheon, Goal Seek Play serves as a distributed primitive-discovery mechanism.

Its operational sequence is:

Invite play
    ↓
Generate strange connections
    ↓
Capture reasoning paths
    ↓
Separate personal detail from reusable structure
    ↓
Extract invariants
    ↓
Test across domains
    ↓
Add validated operators to the corpus
    ↓
Use the expanded corpus to interpret future rounds

The better the pattern library becomes, the more interesting the AI’s guesses become.

The more interesting the guesses become, the more people want to challenge it.

The more they challenge it, the more patterns they contribute.

That is the loop:

Better maps attract stranger travelers. Stranger travelers create better maps.

The strongest implementation choice is to make the reasoning comparison the reward screen, not merely “AI guessed correctly.” That is where the entertainment product becomes a primitive forge.